  "sticker": "bucket",
  "called": "the bucket",
  "skeleton": "a bucket standing on the sand, a spade resting in it and a starfish mould leaning on its side: root at its foot; tip at the bottom's left corner and tipR at its right corner (it rocks on one or the other); body (the bucket) on them; the spade on a bone inside the bucket, layered between the bucket and a front-rim piece, and never keyed: nothing holds it, so it only goes where the bucket goes; mould (the starfish) on its own bone at its foot on the sand, leaning on the bucket, so it leans after the bucket when it tips.",
